WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:32.166
Lord Krishna now turns His attention

2
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:34.666
toward those devotees

3
00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:37.500
who depend on Him completely.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.083
These are devotees who with unwavering faith

5
00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:41.583
and love,

6
00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:45.083
with a single-pointed mind, worship Him.

7
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:47.541
Lord Krishna explains how He Himself

8
00:00:47.541 --> 00:00:50.875
takes care of these devotees' needs

9
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.833
and ensures their protection.

10
00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:00.833
Lord Krishna says

11
00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:01.500
that those

12
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.208
who with exclusive devotion always

13
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:04.958
contemplate Him

14
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:07.791
and with their whole heart worship Him,

15
00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:09.750
they can rest in peace.

16
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.916
He Himself gives them

17
00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:13.583
what they lack,

18
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.750
and what they already have,

19
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.583
He protects.

20
00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:18.958
In this verse,

21
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:22.750
the phrase 'ananyash chintayanto mam'

22
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:23.750
shows the devotee's

23
00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.833
unwavering focus on Lord Krishna,

24
00:01:26.833 --> 00:01:28.208
free from any distraction

25
00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:30.833
or divided attention.

26
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:33.708
Such devotees with Lord Krishna

27
00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:36.666
live in continuous connection,

28
00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:37.666
for their material

29
00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:39.958
and spiritual needs

30
00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:42.083
they trust in Him.

31
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:44.250
Lord Krishna's assurance

32
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.958
is deeply personal.

33
00:01:45.958 --> 00:01:47.833
He does not delegate this responsibility

34
00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:48.708
to anyone else.

35
00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.083
Instead, He Himself takes on

36
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:52.916
the care of His devotees.

37
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:55.541
This reveals His loving

38
00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:58.416
and deep bond with His devotees.

39
00:01:58.416 --> 00:02:01.000
Unlike worshippers of the devas, who

40
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.083
based on their rituals

41
00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:04.750
receive limited fruits,

42
00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.208
Lord Krishna's devotees are cared for

43
00:02:07.208 --> 00:02:09.625
directly by Him,

44
00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:13.916
whether it is material life or spiritual.

45
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:17.125
A story beautifully illustrates this.

46
00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:19.916
A saint named Arjunacharya

47
00:02:19.916 --> 00:02:22.583
doubted Lord Krishna's promise

48
00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:25.500
of carrying His devotees' needs.

49
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.833
Taking it too literally,

50
00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:30.125
he changed the verse.

51
00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:33.208
However, Lord Krishna in disguise

52
00:02:33.208 --> 00:02:36.833
arrived at Arjunacharya's home to deliver food,

53
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:40.041
proving the truth of His own words.

54
00:02:40.041 --> 00:02:41.583
This story sheds light on

55
00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.250
Lord Krishna's active

56
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:46.375
role in a devotee's life.

57
00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:48.791
Lord Krishna further explains

58
00:02:48.791 --> 00:02:51.583
that this is not a transaction,

59
00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:54.958
where He asks for devotion in exchange for care.

60
00:02:54.958 --> 00:02:55.666
Rather,

61
00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:57.000
it is a natural response

62
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.666
born of love.

63
00:02:59.666 --> 00:03:02.583
Just as parents lovingly

64
00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:04.791
care for their child,

65
00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:06.916
Lord Krishna too finds joy

66
00:03:06.916 --> 00:03:09.583
in caring for His devotees.

67
00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:13.666
This verse reveals His boundless compassion

68
00:03:13.666 --> 00:03:15.500
and assures us

69
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.458
that those who are dedicated to Him

70
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:20.750
will never be left unprotected.

71
00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.875
Through this verse, Lord Krishna

72
00:03:23.875 --> 00:03:26.416
encourages us to focus our attention

73
00:03:26.416 --> 00:03:27.416
on Him

74
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:31.166
and to let go of unnecessary worries.

75
00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:33.958
When we focus on the true purpose

76
00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:34.916
of our life,

77
00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:38.875
which is loving service to the Lord,

78
00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:41.583
Lord Krishna assures us

79
00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:45.000
that He Himself carries the burden

80
00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.958
of fulfilling our needs.

81
00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:55.958
Have you ever felt

82
00:03:55.958 --> 00:03:58.000
that the burden of life

83
00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.291
has become so heavy

84
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:04.500
that you are completely alone?

85
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.208
When struggles

86
00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:09.291
seem endless,

87
00:04:09.291 --> 00:04:13.833
the mind sinks into the deep pit of worry.

88
00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:18.541
Usually in such moments people

89
00:04:18.541 --> 00:04:21.333
run toward distractions,

90
00:04:21.333 --> 00:04:24.625
like a thirsty deer

91
00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:28.583
running toward a mirage.

92
00:04:28.583 --> 00:04:32.000
But where is the water there?

93
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.166
In such situations,

94
00:04:34.166 --> 00:04:37.666
always remember,

95
00:04:37.666 --> 00:04:39.833
I am always

96
00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:42.875
near you.

97
00:04:42.875 --> 00:04:47.208
Right at the door of your heart.

98
00:04:47.208 --> 00:04:48.833
Just as

99
00:04:48.833 --> 00:04:54.250
when one end of a lamp's wick is dipped in oil,

100
00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:57.916
the oil spreads through the whole wick,

101
00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:00.083
in the same way I

102
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:03.416
reach every fibre, every thread

103
00:05:03.416 --> 00:05:08.250
of your life's wick.

104
00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.666
But for Me to work,

105
00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:15.333
the first step you must take

106
00:05:15.333 --> 00:05:17.541
is to offer yourself

107
00:05:17.541 --> 00:05:24.083
to My devotion with complete surrender.

108
00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:26.958
When with trust

109
00:05:26.958 --> 00:05:31.500
you walk the right path and your worries

110
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.833
hand over to Me,

111
00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:37.583
I will give you everything

112
00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:41.458
that you truly need.

113
00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:45.000
One who is established in Me

114
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:51.416
never finds themselves alone.

115
00:05:51.416 --> 00:05:53.291
This is My promise.

116
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:01.875
Letters joining letters

117
00:06:01.875 --> 00:06:04.750
form a word.

118
00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:11.000
Words finding meaning
together become a sentence.

119
00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:15.416
In this space, the joyful meeting of all,

120
00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:19.125
creates a family.

121
00:06:19.125 --> 00:06:21.500
As a family,

122
00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.750
when you come together

123
00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.500
in devotion,

124
00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.833
remember Me,

125
00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:32.291
worship Me,

126
00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:36.500
and walk by the principles I have shared,

127
00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.166
then in your home

128
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:43.375
you invite My presence.

129
00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:48.208
Just as a mother cares for her infant,

130
00:06:48.208 --> 00:06:50.041
attending to every

131
00:06:50.041 --> 00:06:53.083
small need of theirs,

132
00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:56.250
in the same way I

133
00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:59.250
care for My devotees.

134
00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:03.083
Do you know?

135
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:05.333
With a sincere heart

136
00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:10.375
a family dedicated to Me, their protection

137
00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:13.416
I Myself take on.

138
00:07:13.416 --> 00:07:17.750
You do not have to carry
the burden of every worry.

139
00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:22.083
Fulfil your duties with honesty

140
00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:27.541
and keep your life aligned with dharma.

141
00:07:27.541 --> 00:07:29.875
Blessed are those families

142
00:07:29.875 --> 00:07:32.791
who have faith in Me

143
00:07:32.791 --> 00:07:36.708
and remain united in devotion, because

144
00:07:36.708 --> 00:07:38.666
I take care of all

145
00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:40.708
their needs,

146
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:44.875
both material and spiritual.

147
00:07:44.875 --> 00:07:49.708
This is not a transaction.

148
00:07:49.708 --> 00:07:53.791
It is the natural response of love.

149
00:07:53.791 --> 00:07:55.791
The family that

150
00:07:55.791 --> 00:07:58.916
comes to My feet,

151
00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:01.916
of their joys and sorrows the bearer

152
00:08:01.916 --> 00:08:05.750
I Myself become.

153
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.541
You simply fulfil your responsibility,

154
00:08:10.541 --> 00:08:12.833
and I will

155
00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:13.791
fulfil Mine.

156
00:08:18.541 --> 00:08:22.208
Picture the scene of your workplace.

157
00:08:22.208 --> 00:08:26.208
Time pressure, deadlines, competition,

158
00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:28.041
and surrounded by stress,

159
00:08:28.041 --> 00:08:31.333
you remain caught up in your work.

160
00:08:31.333 --> 00:08:33.750
In your professional life

161
00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.083
to face challenges

162
00:08:36.083 --> 00:08:38.458
and to achieve your goals,

163
00:08:38.458 --> 00:08:39.666
you rely on your skills,

164
00:08:39.666 --> 00:08:43.291
abilities, and hard work.

165
00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:47.000
But notice this, a time will come

166
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:51.000
when problems will feel as vast as a mountain.

167
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.666
When no expertise

168
00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:57.625
can guarantee success,

169
00:08:57.625 --> 00:09:01.041
in those moments you have

170
00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:04.250
such a resource

171
00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:08.250
that you can always rely on.

172
00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.125
Any guess?

173
00:09:10.125 --> 00:09:13.375
Yes, you, and that is

174
00:09:13.375 --> 00:09:17.750
your relationship with Me.

175
00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:21.375
Just as a sailor looks to the stars to find

176
00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:24.625
direction and gives guidance,

177
00:09:24.625 --> 00:09:29.500
in the same way I am that star in your life

178
00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:33.666
who will always guide you.

179
00:09:33.666 --> 00:09:37.375
When remembering Me, with faith

180
00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:40.958
and dedication you do your work,

181
00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:43.875
then I personally

182
00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:47.041
am ready to stand by you.

183
00:09:47.041 --> 00:09:49.166
This does not mean

184
00:09:49.166 --> 00:09:51.666
that in your life challenges

185
00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:54.833
or failures will not come.

186
00:09:54.833 --> 00:09:58.375
They are part of the journey, but

187
00:09:58.375 --> 00:10:02.875
you will never face them alone.

188
00:10:02.875 --> 00:10:07.750
Remember, I am the charioteer
 of your life's chariot,

189
00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.583
and just as for Arjun

190
00:10:10.583 --> 00:10:15.500
I guided him in the right direction, for you too

191
00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.000
I am always with you.
